{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10113140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10113140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011314001:0":{"text":"이건 다프니 할머니가 설치해 둔 장애물이에요. 뒤쪽이 바로 부패한 뿌리가 있는 오솔길이고요.","source_cn":"这是达赫妮婆婆设下的防碍，后面就是生有腐化根茎的小路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1699120750E0DA13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011314002:0":{"text":"마을 사람들이 이곳으로 잘못 들어와서 부패의 영향을 받을까 봐 우선은 넝쿨로 다리를 봉쇄해 두었죠.","source_cn":"因为担心村民误入这里，被腐化影响，所以先用藤蔓封住了桥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85696E40DAAE8EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}